PETSELFTEST1
# V4-08 microphone games: clap the rhythm back, blow out the candles. The
# script is the "microphone": synthetic loudness numbers (never audio) are
# fed to the real classifier, and the real microphone tap stays off for the
# whole run (expect none:src=audio). Needs no TF pack; run outside the quiet
# hours (default 20:30-07:00) and above the low-battery level, or the Game
# item only says hi (PET_GAME_REFUSED).
# Game 1 (clap): the demo plays three beats (700/700 ms), then "your turn"
#   and 0.8 s later the board listens; claps 700/700 right, then round 2
#   (500/1000) right: completed, growth.
# Game 2 (candles): speech, a clap and room noise do nothing; a 5 s blow
#   puts out the three candles (0.7 s steady blow each): completed, growth.
# Game 3 (candles): the same distractors, then a long press goes home: no
#   candle, no growth.
# Counted from "mark begin" (see tools/selftest_report.py). Games are UI
# only: no pet commits.
# expect commits 0
# expect min:PET_GAME_START 3
# expect min:src=mic 3
# expect none:PET_GAME_REFUSED 0
# expect none:PET_MIC_GAME_START_FAILED 0
# expect none:src=audio 0
# expect min:src=script 4
# expect min:PET_MIC_TAP 8
# expect min:feedback=right 2
# expect min:kind=clap 6
# expect min:kind=blow 1
# expect min:PET_MIC_CANDLE 3
# expect min:end=completed 2
# expect min:end=home 1
# expect min:correct=2 1
# expect min:growth=1 2
# expect min:growth=0 1
# expect min:PET_GAME_QUEUED 10
# expect none:PET_SELFTEST_ABORT 0
# expect selftest_done 1
# expect max_partial_ms 2500
# Quiet prompts while testing (RAM only, this boot).
# The Game / Feed rail items refuse in the quiet hours (PET_GAME_REFUSED
# reason=quiet; Feed then falls back to the V7 plain feed), so pin the day phase:
# the 2026-11-07 22:22 board run showed 3 plain feeds (241,242,242) here.
phase day
volume 15
# Start as soon as XiaoZhi is idle, not after a fixed 20 s.
waitidle 60000
pet
wait 6000
# Normalize restored pet state to "home, neutral".
tap press 6000
hold press 1500 6000
mark begin
# Home rail: left end (Chat), then two to the right = Game.
tap up 800
tap up 800
tap up 800
tap up 800
tap down 800
tap down 2000
# Game 1: clap the rhythm back (the first clap comes ~5.6 s after the
# press, the board listens from ~4.6 s).
micgame clap
tap press 5500
envelope clap 700
envelope clap 700
envelope clap 700
# Round 2 starts 2.5 s after the third clap and listens from 4.7 s on.
wait 6900
envelope clap 500
envelope clap 1000
envelope clap 300
# 2.5 s of happy TuanTuan, then the game says goodbye and goes home.
wait 8000
# Game 2: candles. Distractors first (guarded start tone, then listening).
micgame candle
tap press 5000
envelope speech 3000
envelope clap 400
envelope noise 2000
envelope blow 5000
wait 8000
# Game 3: the same distractors, nobody blows: a long press goes home.
micgame candle
tap press 5000
envelope speech 3000
envelope clap 400
envelope noise 2000
hold press 1500 8000
end
